ver but reverent  decision by Netflix to both build  mystery and Intrigue around the show but  also to treat the sensitive topic with a  degree of respect it is a story about  genre but is also a story about the  victims it seems like the show took  great care in telling this story  reminding each other daily of the one  rule of putting this show on and why it  was a story worth telling what are your  thoughts on the making of the show do  you think you would have enjoyed a day  on set why or why not let us know in the  comments below

